  "ruleText": "Bar 101.49 “Shop instructor” means any person licensed by the board to teach in a shop.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Bar 100) #6046-a, eff 6-1-95, EXPIRED: 6-1-03\n\nNew. #7932, eff 8-3-03; ss by #10412-A, eff 9-19-13 (from Bar 101.34); renumbered by #13810 (formerly Bar 101.35) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Bar 100); renumbered by #14459, eff 1-1-26 (formerly Bar 101.33)",
